  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-14T08:00:56.325Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, the player client doesn't render your own 'hair' or any thing skinned to a bone that's a child of your avatar's head. This makes it hard to interact with your own hair to get a good screenshot. Is this being revisited for Avatar Dynamics?",
